<title>UK: Perez Companc sets 300 billion lire FRN.</title>
<headline>Perez Companc sets 300 billion lire FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PEREZ COMPANC SA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    01.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     165 BP    PAY DATE    01.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY B1	  ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   60 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BB-	 REOFFER    100.0</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) FIVE    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  40 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
